    },
    "body": "This document specifies the contents of the version packet of the V2 Transport defined in [BIP 324](https://github.com/bitcoin/bips/blob/master/bip-0324.mediawiki), which BIP 324 leaves unspecified and sends empty. Redefined as a negotiation packet, it carries a list of features, each a modification to the Transport Layer such as an encryption upgrade or authentication.\n\nRelevant discussions for this BIP are here:\nhttps://groups.google.com/g/bitcoindev/c/LbTSN08fYlM\nhttps://groups.google.com/g/bitcoindev/c/n_5WuKVYqwI\n\nSummary of diff of spec as written versus proposed:\n- Open questions have been decided\n- Tightened definitions and clarified rules\n- Added packet exchange diagram and external header table based off BIP-324.",
